OL,3,GNEWSA'I was stuck on a plane for six
OL,4,Ahours - then the flight was cancelled'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers have been describing the
OL,7,Fchaos at London Stansted Airport after
OL,8,Fair traffic control issues caused major
OL,9,Fdisruption and saw flights cancelled.
OL,11,FAn estimated 250,000 people had their
OL,12,Ftravel plans disrupted on Tuesday, with
OL,13,F1,750 flights axed.
OL,15,FNats, the air traffic control provider,
OL,16,Fblamed a technical glitch and its boss
OL,17,FMartin Rolfe apologised, admitting
OL,18,Fresolving the issue had taken "longer
OL,19,Fthan hoped".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
