OL,3,GNEWSA'I was stuck on a plane for six
OL,4,Ahours - then the flight was cancelled'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie Daines, 20, from Bury St Edmunds,
OL,7,FSuffolk, said: "I've never seen
OL,8,Fanything like it, everybody just stood
OL,9,Faround. Nobody knowing where to go,
OL,10,Fwhat to do. Even the staff of most
OL,11,Fairlines didn't have a clue what to
OL,12,Fdo."
